# ai-skills default one-way-door floor (scope 10 §4.1) — read by scripts/door.py.
# gitignore-style globs, matched case-insensitively against repo-relative paths.
# A touched path matching any line makes the change one-way. `!` negation is NOT
# supported (ignored): a floor that can be un-listed is not a floor. A repo adds
# its own lines in `.one-way-doors` at its root; those only ever add to this list.

# migrations
migrations/
migration/
migrate/
db/migrate/
# protos / OpenAPI
*.proto
openapi*.yaml
openapi*.yml
openapi*.json
swagger*.yaml
swagger*.yml
swagger*.json
# ADRs
adr/
adrs/
ADR-*.md
# infra Terraform
*.tf
*.tfvars
*.tf.json
terraform/
# SSM / env
.env
.env.*
ssm/
# prod
prod/
production/
*.prod.*
*-prod.*
prod.*
# CI definitions (10.3-r1-05): a PR that edits the CI producing its own green runs never
# auto-merges — "real green" is self-referential when the job itself changed
.github/workflows/
.github/actions/
CODEOWNERS
.circleci/
.gitlab-ci.yml
Jenkinsfile
buildspec*.yml
buildspec*.yaml
